# No Hardcoded Project IDs
RULE: All project IDs from config. Never hardcode central-element-* or any project ID string.
WHY: Security risk; breaks multi-tenant; tests must use test-project placeholder.
CODEX: 05-infrastructure/cloud-agnostic-migration.md, .cursor/rules/quality-gates-audit-factors.mdc
DO: Use config.gcp_project_id; GCP_PROJECT_ID env; test-project in tests
NEVER: "central-element-323112"; os.getenv(..., "central-element-*"); real project ID in .env.example
